    "title": "Henderson Co. coasts to the regional final with big win over Hopkinsville - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ayden Crowley ,\n42 minutes ago\nHENDERSON, Ky. (WEHT) — The Henderson Co. Colonels continue to dominate in the postseason with a 7-1 victory over the Hopkinsville Tigers to advance to the regional final.\nThe Colonels have outscored opponents in Region Two 15-1 this postseason.\nHenderson Co. advances to take on University Heights on Oct. 16.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
